# Throwaway auth-seed page used to drive a headless browser against a local Wrangler
# session. It embeds a live session cookie, so it must never be committable even if a
# `git add -A` runs while a screenshot is in flight — which is exactly how one reached
# history in 280f0db.
funnel/_ccseed.html
_ccseed.html

# Chrome Web Store upload artifact, rebuilt on demand by
# `node tools/product-scraper-extension/pack.mjs`. Deterministic from the source in
# that folder, so committing it would only add binary churn to every extension change.
tools/product-scraper-extension/dist/
